    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="purpose">
      <h2 id="purpose">Purpose</h2>
      
      <p>Provide a blank text template for recording a synthetic <span class="term" data-pv="term:cost_baseline" data-pv-title="cost baseline" data-pv-body="Synthetic time-phased budget basis used to measure synthetic estimating variance.">cost baseline</span> update.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="the-rule">
      <h2 id="the-rule">The rule</h2>
      
      <p>Submit the completed synthetic form within the 10 days <span class="term" data-pv="term:rate_window" data-pv-title="rate window" data-pv-body="Synthetic period allowed to complete a forward pricing rate check.">rate window</span> <a id="cite-ref-1-1" class="cite-n" href="#cite-1" data-pv="cite:1" data-pv-title="CL-EST-0003" data-pv-body="Synthetic rate review window is 10 days under current guidance." aria-label="Source 1">1</a>.</p>
<pre><code>Baseline ID: ____
Rate window check: ____
Escalation assumption: ____
Reviewer role: ____
</code></pre>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <h2 id="how-it-works">How it works</h2>
      
      <p>Copy the fenced text block into a working note and fill each line before the rate review.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="worked-example">
      <h2 id="worked-example">Worked example</h2>
      
      <p>Synthetic example. The numbers are made up.</p>
<p>An estimator fills all 4 lines for baseline B-101 in 15 minutes before the review meeting.</p>

      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="never-confuse">
      <h2 id="never-confuse">Never confuse</h2>
      
      <p>Do not confuse a blank synthetic text template with an approved decision package.</p>

      
      
    </section>

    <section class="part" aria-labelledby="company-calibration">
      <h2 id="company-calibration">Company calibration</h2>
      
      <details class="fold company-fold">
        <summary><b>Company questions</b> <span class="meta">1 to settle with company data</span></summary>
      
      
      <p>Confirm where completed baseline notes are stored <span class="cite neutral" data-pv="q:Q-002" data-pv-title="Q-002" data-pv-body="Which synthetic escalation index applies to multi-year pricing workbooks?">Q-002</span>.</p>

      
      
      </details>
      
    </section>

